==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.1 Update|Version 15.1]], in all versions besides the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese Version]], [[Blue Shinobi (Special Cat)|Blue Shinobi]] was in this Event Gacha. Version 15.1 replaced Blue Shinobi with [[Baozi Cat (Special Cat)|Baozi Cat]] to match the Japanese Version.
*In Version 15.1, the French and Italian languages of the English Version had broken text show up when viewing the result of a roll. This was later fixed in Version 15.1.1.
*The English banner has a grammatical error in its description of Ancient Egg: N204. It says "Evolve it to it's True Form, and…?", but "it's" is incorrect here, and the phrase should read "its true form". The difference is that "its" is a possessive pronoun, whereas "it's" means "it is".

